.TP
\fB\-\-group GROUP\fR
only this section (machine/network/ai/recovery/monitoring/...)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
\&
.RE
.TP
\fBbastion config get\fR
print one setting's current value
.RS
.TP
\fBkey\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
\&
.RE
.TP
\fBbastion config describe\fR
explain a setting + what changing it does
.RS
.TP
\fBkey\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
