.PP
\fBbastion firewall\fR \fI{reload | status}\fR [options]
.TP
\fB{reload | status}\fR
\&
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
path to machine.conf
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
operate under this base dir instead of /
.SS ai
control the L3 AI analysis layer (operator kill switch)
.PP
\fBbastion ai\fR \fI{enable | disable | panic | status | proposals | accept | reject | rollback | set\-interval | set\-depth}\fR \fIid\fR [options]
.TP
\fB{enable | disable | panic | status | proposals | accept | reject | rollback | set\-interval | set\-depth}\fR
enable/disable arm the AI timer; panic flushes ai_* now; status shows state; proposals lists the review queue; accept/reject <id> resolve a proposal; rollback <id> undoes one audit record; set\-interval <dur> / set\-depth <level> change config
.TP
\fBid\fR
id for accept/reject/rollback, or value for set\-interval/set\-depth
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
path to machine.conf
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
operate under this base dir instead of /
