.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
operate under this base dir instead of /
.SS confirm
confirm egress is stable, then disarm the watchdog (net\-confirm)
.PP
\fBbastion confirm\fR [options]
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
disarm the deadman even if the egress probe fails \(em you assert you are present and want to KEEP this config (egress is NOT verified)
.TP
\fB\-\-conf CONF\fR
path to machine.conf
.TP
\fB\-\-root ROOT\fR
operate under this base dir instead of /
.SS switch
